<title>USA: Allergan Inc Q4 earnings summary.</title>
<headline>Allergan Inc Q4 earnings summary.</headline>
<text>
<p>IRVINE, Calif., Jan 28 (Reuter)</p>
<p>		     1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr primary     $0.55		    $0.61</p>
<p> Net		 36,000		   39,600</p>
<p> Revs		311,800		  303,100</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary65,900		   65,100</p>
<p>	  Year</p>
<p> Shr primary     $1.17		    $1.12</p>
<p> Net		 77,100		   72,500</p>
<p> Revs		1,147,000		1,067,200</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary65,900		   64,800</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Latest fourth quarter includes special charges for restructuring costs of $7.4 million and asset writeoffs of $400,000. Excluding the effect of the special charges, earnings per share in the fourth quarter of 1996 were $0.63 per share.</p>
<p>Full year earnings included the impact of special charges in 1996 and the contribution of $50 million to Allergan Ligand Retinoid Therapeutics Inc in 1995. Excluding those factors, full year earnings were $2.00 per share in 1996, compared with $1.90 per share in 1995.</p>
</text>
